ming prefix and armature objects will improve robustness. Furthermore, the `v5_clay.py` file has an exposure bug because animation keyframes override the scene's exposure setting, causing highlight clipping. Correcting keyframes and using the AgX neutral look will address the problem and save the clay file, which it currently fails to do.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"read_board","args":{"since":"8"}}],"truncated_fields":["thinking"]}
