{"step_index":54,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-18T05:53:48Z","content":"Created At: 2026-11-18T13:53:48+08:00\nCompleted At: 2026-11-18T13:53:50+08:00\n{\"messages\":[{\"seq\":10,\"agent\":\"anim\",\"text\":\"@env-2 Extra raycast finding on #9: `V5_Stand_Complex` (`s=3540, side=-1, length=120, dist=30`) is a straight 120m box on the inside of Copse/Maggotts complex whose rail end `(-565.0, 820.6)` intrudes onto the live track (`1.6m` from car at `f=1372`, blocking `Cam_S16_ChaseCopse` behind the car). Moving `V5_Stand_Complex` `dist` to `\\u003e=38` (or `side=1` / shorter length) clears the track completely.\",\"time\":\"2026-11-18 13:37:34\",\"request_id\":\"f2bfca7c-44c2-4b3a-b3d8-4ff2918e2294\"},{\"seq\":11,\"agent\":\"sfx\",\"text\":\"@anim Audio Synthesis \\u0026 Video Muxing deliverables (`#4`) are complete and verified — ready for your `README.md`, `LATEST/README.txt`, and `docs/README_V5.md` (§7 files/repro \\u0026 §8 engine SFX update) documentation sync:\\n\\n### 1. New Script \\u0026 Updated Mux Pipelines\\n- `pipeline/synth_sfx.py` (`43,538 B`): Telemetry-synced F1 1.6L V6 Turbo-Hybrid synthesizer (48 kHz, 16-bit stereo PCM, 0 `bpy` dependency; reads `track_data/silverstone_track.json` + AST-parses `SHOTS` from `pipeline/v5_anim.py`, supporting optional `side` on `onboard` too).\\n  - **Powertrain**: 8-speed seamless gearbox (`52` upshifts / `52` downshifts across lap; RPM `9,853–12,432` for `v \\u003e= 80 km/h`), tractive throttle (`dv/dt + aero_drag`), `~45 ms` upshift ignition-cut torque hole + exhaust collector bark, `~58 ms` downshift rev-match blips, MGU-H turbo spool (`2.65–5.4 kHz` whistle + lift-off flutter) \\u0026 MGU-K whine.\\n  - **Timbre \\u0026 Acoustics**: Crank/3-cyl bank sub-orders (`0.33x, 0.5x, 1.5x f0`) + `f0..8f0` firing harmonics (`f0 = RPM/60 * 3`), turbulent valve-pulse modulation, asymmetric manifold saturation + multi-formant resonator banks (`onboard` airbox vs `exhaust` vs `distant`), aero wind (`~ v^2`), serrated kerb rumble (`|curv| \\u003e 0.008`, `f = v/0.28 Hz`), and 26-shot camera perspective modeling:\\n    - `Fixed` (`S04, S08, S11, S13, S17, S20, S24`): physical Doppler\n<truncated 2537 bytes>\n-cd3fa96378f9\"},{\"seq\":13,\"agent\":\"coordinator\",\"text\":\"@env-2 Server restarted mid-turn — resume from where you left off (`pipeline/gen_textures.py` is already saved). Finish upgrading `pipeline/v5_env.py` incorporating all findings in #9 and #10 (`V5_Hangar` min track dist \\u003e= 180m, `V5_HedgeRing` radius \\u003e= 1500m, `V5_Stand_Complex` moved back `dist \\u003e= 38` so rail clears Copse track, `V5_Flag` `/255.0` linear albedo fix, dedicated single-user `Mat_FIA_RainLight`, smooth `V5_SkyDome` gradient, braking-zone skidmarks/DRS boards/pit timing, car paint/carbon/brake-rotor material polish, zero stranded root objects), run `v5_env.py` -\\u003e `LATEST/v5_stage_env.blend` and `v5_preview.py`, verify via Python PIL metrics (remember #7: NEVER call `read_file` on binary/image files), and post handoff naming `@anim`.\",\"time\":\"2026-11-18 13:53:29\",\"request_id\":\"bd126993-c4a5-452a-b4ea-b568b206d514\"},{\"seq\":14,\"agent\":\"coordinator\",\"text\":\"@anim Server restarted mid-turn — resume from where you left off (`v5_anim.py`, `v5_clay.py`, `v5_stills.py`, `v5_viewport_fast.py` edits are on disk). Remember #7 (NEVER call `read_file` on binary/image files; use Python PIL/numpy + Blender headless checks). Check #11 from `sfx` for the exact audio/mux commands \\u0026 metrics to include in `README.md`, `LATEST/README.txt`, and `docs/README_V5.md`. Wait via `swarm_wait` if `@env-2` hasn't finished `LATEST/v5_stage_env.blend` yet; as soon as `@env-2` hands off, run final `v5_anim.py` -\\u003e `LATEST/v5_stage_anim.blend`, `v5_clay.py` -\\u003e `LATEST/v5_stage_anim_clay.blend`, `v5_viewport_fast.py` fast/normal check, render all 26 1080p color stills + contact sheet (`renders_v5/stills/`) and clay test stills (`renders_v5/clay_