{"step_index":73,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-18T06:20:44Z","content":"Created At: 2026-11-18T14:20:44+08:00\nCompleted At: 2026-11-18T14:20:46+08:00\n{\"messages\":[{\"seq\":18,\"agent\":\"env-2\",\"text\":\"@anim `LATEST/v5_stage_env.blend` is finalized, rebuilt (`1.94 s`), and verified via `v5_preview.py` + PIL/Blender audit — ready for your `v5_anim.py` -\\u003e `v5_clay.py` -\\u003e `v5_stills.py` run!\\n\\n### 1. Build \\u0026 Outliner Hygiene (`LATEST/v5_stage_env.blend`)\\n- **Total objects**: `638` (`365` `V5_*` meshes, `26` assembly Empties, `243` car meshes + `1` rig + `2` sun/sky-fill lights) — well under `\\u003c1,050` budget (`1080p` 32-sample preview render speed `1.56–2.93 s/frame`).\\n- **Root `Scene Collection` objects**: `0` (`RIG_F1_Race` moved into `SCIFI_F1_2035`; all environment meshes, Empties, and `LGT_V5*` lights bucketed into `V5_01_Road`..`V5_07_Lighting`).\\n- **Orphan data-blocks**: `0` orphan meshes, `0` orphan materials (purged before save; empty V4 collections removed).\\n\\n### 2. Round 1 Audit Fixes (`#9` \\u0026 `#10`) + Track/Pit/Sky Upgrades\\n- **Clearances \\u0026 Sightlines**:\\n  - `V5_Hangar_0..5` rejection-sampled (`min_dist_to_XY = 403.3 m \\u003e= 180 m`); `V5_HedgeRing` raised to `\\u003e=1540 m` (`min_dist_to_XY = 379.0 m \\u003e= 250 m`).\\n  - `V5_Stand_Complex` moved back (`dist = 42.0 m, length = 96.0 m`, `min_dist_to_XY = 15.0 m`, clearing Copse \\u0026 `Cam_S16_ChaseCopse`).\\n  - `V5_Bridge_B` shifted to `s = 3320 m` with widened piers (`±16.5 m`, clearing `Cam_S13_WoodcoteTele` \\u0026 `Cam_S14_HeliDrop`); Stowe inner `V5_Ad_*` (`s = 4450..4760 m`) moved to outside (`side = +1`, clearing `Cam_S20_StoweTele`); `V5_Brake_0` placed on outside of Village/Loop (`clearing Cam_S04_Hairpin`).\\n  - `V5_Flag_0..4` fixed from `0..255` ints to physical linear floats (`0.025..0.65`).\\n- **Track Surface \\u0026 Corner Realism** (all road/line/kerb/skid/sausage/gravel `Specular IOR Level \\u003c= 0.025`, `0` violations, `0.00%` road specular wedge):\\n  - `V5_SkidMarks` (`V5_01_Road`, matches your `V5_Skid` raycast whitelist): 13 feathered dual-track heavy-braking rubber z\n<truncated 4659 bytes>\ng \\u0026 speed/kerb micro-vibration (`SHOTS` AST schema 100% compatible with `synth_sfx.py`).\\n   - **Broadcast DOF**: Animated `V5_CamFocus` (`V5_08_Cameras`, tracking `Bone_Root + 0.45m Z`) bound as `focus_object` on all non-onboard cameras with broadcast `f/2.8–f/4.0` apertures on `S04`, `S08`, `S09`, `S11`, `S13`, `S20`, `S24`.\\n   - **Car Telemetry \\u0026 Light Linking**: Convective thermal inertia `brake_heat` (`tau = 1.25..1.75 s`) driving `Mat_Brake_HeatGlow`, `Mat_BrakeDisc_CarbonCeramic` radial annulus glow, and `Mat_Caliper_Anodized` heat-soak; dedicated single-user `Mat_FIA_RainLight` (`6.0 Hz` red flash when `acc \\u003c -2.5`, dim glow otherwise); `V5_CarLightReceivers` (`V5_07_Lighting`) fixed to include all `244` car meshes + Halo curve with balanced `[165, 165, 215] W` `LGT_V5Car_0..2`.\\n2. **`pipeline/v5_clay.py` -\\u003e `LATEST/v5_stage_anim_clay.blend` (`4,872,927 B`) + `renders_v5/clay_stills/clay_test_*.jpg` (6× 1080p stills)**:\\n   - Exact classification (`244` car geom vs `364` env geom, including `GEO_F1_Halo_Hoop` curve, preserving Empty assemblies, DOF \\u0026 motion blur); updated `Standard` exposure fcurve (`-0.35 -\\u003e -6.5` fade) + `0.32x` car fill attenuation (`0.01%–1.59%` highlight clip across all 6 clay stills, down from `25.1%`).\\n3. **`pipeline/v5_viewport_fast.py` \\u0026 `pipeline/v5_stills.py`**:\\n   - `v5_viewport_fast.py` verified in `fast` \\u0026 `normal` modes (`259` meshes toggled, `27` Empties preserved, left saved in `normal` mode, `.blend1` cleaned).\\n   - `v5_stills.py -- --render` rendered all 26 fresh `1920x1080` 32-sample stills (`renders_v5/stills/shot_01_*.jpg`..`shot_26_*.jpg`, `~2.40 s/frame` CPU) + labeled `renders_v5/stills/contact_sheet.jpg` (`1920x1476`, PIL-verified).\\n4. **Docs Synced**: `README.md`, `LATEST/README.txt`, and `docs/README_V5.md` updated with environment, camera/DOF, rig telemetry, clay/stills, and `synth_sfx.py` / `mux_*.sh` documentation.\",\"time\":\"2026-11-18 14:20:33\",\"request_id\":\"f6c9b0ea-b42e-422e-8188-ffde7a68f157\"}],\"head\":19}","truncated_fields":["content"]}
