{"step_index":76,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-18T06:21:02Z","content":"Created At: 2026-11-18T14:21:02+08:00\nCompleted At: 2026-11-18T14:21:15+08:00\nShowing lines 1-67 of 67\n1: # -*- coding: utf-8 -*-\n2: \"\"\"\n3: 视口加速开关：把重物件在视口里降级，渲染完全不受影响。\n4: \n5: 用法:\n6:   blender -b LATEST/v5_stage_anim.blend -P pipeline/v5_viewport_fast.py -- fast\n7:   blender -b LATEST/v5_stage_anim.blend -P pipeline/v5_viewport_fast.py -- normal\n8: \n9: fast   : 看台/道具/地形集合视口隐藏 + 重网格只显示包围盒（BOUNDS）\n10: normal : 恢复实体贴图显示（TEXTURED）\n11: \n12: 注意：改的是 hide_viewport / display_type（仅对 MESH 生效，跳过 EMPTY 组件父物体），\n13: 渲染（F12 / 命令行动画渲染）不受任何影响。默认写回当前打开的 .blend（传 --no-save 可跳过保存）。\n14: \"\"\"\n15: import bpy\n16: import sys\n17: \n18: ARGV = sys.argv[sys.argv.index(\"--\") + 1:] if \"--\" in sys.argv else []\n19: MODE = (ARGV[0] if ARGV and not ARGV[0].startswith(\"--\") else \"fast\").lower()\n20: NO_SAVE = \"--no-save\" in ARGV\n21: \n22: HEAVY_COLLS = (\"V5_04_Stands\", \"V5_06_Props\", \"V5_02_Terrain\")\n23: HEAVY_OBJ_PREFIX = (\n24:     \"V5_Stand_\", \"V5_Ad_\", \"V5_Brake_\", \"V5_Marshal_\",\n25:     \"V5_Screen_\", \"V5_Bridge_\", \"V5_Hangar_\", \"V5_Gantry\",\n26:     \"V5_Pit\", \"V5_Barrier\", \"V5_FencePosts\", \"V5_DRS\",\n27:     \"V5_Apex\", \"V5_Bollard\", \"V5_Sausage\", \"EM_\",\n28: )\n29: \n30: fast = MODE.startswith(\"fast\")\n31: \n32: # 1) 集合视口显隐\n33: for c in bpy.data.collections:\n34:     if c.name in HEAVY_COLLS:\n35:         c.hide_viewport = fast\n36: \n37: # 2) 重网格显示模式（仅对 MESH 设置 display_type，兼容 EM_* / V5_* Empty 组件父子层级）\n38: changed = 0\n39: empties_checked = 0\n40: for ob in bpy.data.objects:\n41:     if ob.type == 'EMPTY' and ob.name.startswith((\"V5_\", \"EM_\")):\n42:         empties_checked += 1\n43:         continue\n44:     if ob.type != 'MESH':\n45:         continue\n46:     in_heavy_parent = (ob.parent is not None and ob.parent.type == 'EMPTY'\n47:                        and ob.parent.name.startswith((\"V5_\", \"EM_\")))\n48:     if not (ob.name.startswith(HEAVY_OBJ_PREFIX) or in_heavy_parent):\n49:         continue\n50:     ob.display_type = 'BOUNDS' if fast else 'TEXTURED'\n51:     changed += 1\n52: \n53: # 3) 视口采样（只影响交互视口，不影响最终渲染）\n54: sc = bpy.context.scene\n55: try:\n56:     sc.eevee.taa_samples = 8 if fast else 16\n57: except Exception:\n58:     pass\n59: \n60: hidden_colls = [c.name for c in bpy.data.collections\n61:                 if c.name in HEAVY_COLLS and c.hide_viewport]\n62: print(\"viewport mode = %s | mesh display_type changed = %d | empties preserved = %d | collections hidden = %s\"\n63:       % (\"fast\" if fast else \"normal\", changed, empties_checked, hidden_colls))\n64: \n65: if bpy.data.filepath and not NO_SAVE:\n66:     bpy.ops.wm.save_mainfile()\n67:     print(\"SAVED:\", bpy.data.filepath)"}
{"step_index":77,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-18T06:21:03Z","content":"Created At: 2026-11-18T14:21:03+08:00\nCompleted At: 2026-11-18T14:21:15+08:00\nShowing lines 1-105 of 105\n1: # blender-supercar\n2: \n3: 真实银石赛道整圈的 AI 程序化 F1 赛车全链路工程（Blender 5.3.0 / EEVEE 纯 CPU / 26 机位广播级运镜 + 遥测驱动 V6 混动引擎音效）。\n4: \n5: ## 目录\n6: \n7: | 目录 | 内容 | 说明 |\n8: |---|---|---|\n9: | **[LATEST/](LATEST/)** | `v5_stage_anim.blend`、`v5_stage_env.blend`、`v5_stage_anim_clay.blend` | **最新工程，只放这三个**（彩色完整动画 / 纯环境 / 白模动画） |\n10: | [pipeline/](pipeline/) | `gen_textures.py`、`v5_env.py`、`v5_anim.py`、`v5_clay.py`、`v5_stills.py`、`v5_viewport_fast.py`、`v5_preview.py`、`synth_sfx.py`、`render_v5.py`、`render_clay.py`、`mux_v5.sh`、`mux_clay.sh`、`v4_stage_rig.blend` | 现役全自动脚本管线；`v4_stage_rig.blend` 是模型+骨架输入 |\n11: | [renders_v5/](renders_v5/) | 引擎混音成片 `*_sfx_1080p.mp4`、纯配乐成片 `*_1080p.mp4`、无声版 `*_silent.mp4`、`sfx_engine_90s.wav`、`audio_v5_sfx_mix_90s.m4a`、`stills/`、`clay_stills/`、`frames/`、`clay_frames/` | 最新视频、音轨与 26 镜头剧照产物 |\n12: | [textures/](textures/) | 人群 / 车库楼 / 赞助广告板 / 刹车牌 / DRS 牌 / 实时计时大屏贴图 | 由 `pipeline/gen_textures.py`（Pillow）高清程序化生成 |\n13: | [track_data/](track_data/) | Silverstone / Monza 的 json+csv+生成器 | **改赛道几何与速度规划就改这里** |\n14: | [audio/](audio/) | `audio.wav`（原曲）、`beats.json`、`cue.json` | 108 BPM 拍点数据 |\n15: | **[scenes/](scenes/)** | 场景库：历届赛历、天气预设、8 个精选场景卡、AI 提示词包 | **拍什么先看这里** |\n16: | [docs/](docs/) | [docs/README_V5.md](docs/README_V5.md)（主技术文档）、`README_V4.md`、赛道数据说明 | 物理规则、机位表、材质/遥测/音效细节 |\n17: | [archive/](archive/) | `blend/` 旧工程、`scripts/` 旧脚本、`renders/` 旧成片 | 只读归档，勿在\n<truncated 4049 bytes>\n``bash\n67: B=\"/d/APPs/steam/steamapps/common/Blender/blender.exe\"\n68: python pipeline/gen_textures.py    # 生成高清程序化贴图\n69: \"$B\" -b -P pipeline/v5_env.py      # 构建银石环境 -> LATEST/v5_stage_env.blend\n70: \"$B\" -b -P pipeline/v5_anim.py     # 烘焙动画 + 26 机位 + 遮挡/物理自检 -> LATEST/v5_stage_anim.blend\n71: \"$B\" -b -P pipeline/render_v5.py   # 终渲 2161 帧 1080p（约 30 min）\n72: python pipeline/synth_sfx.py       # 合成遥测引擎音效\n73: bash pipeline/mux_v5.sh            # 封装全部彩色 MP4 成片\n74: ```\n75: \n76: **3. 快速重出全部 26 镜头 1080p 剧照与拼图（无需重渲 2161 帧，约 1 min）**\n77: \n78: ```bash\n79: B=\"/d/APPs/steam/steamapps/common/Blender/blender.exe\"\n80: \"$B\" -b LATEST/v5_stage_anim.blend -P pipeline/v5_stills.py -- --render\n81: # 输出 renders_v5/stills/shot_01_*.jpg .. shot_26_*.jpg 与带机位焦段/光圈标注的 contact_sheet.jpg\n82: \n83: # 单帧快速抽检（输出至 renders_v5/test/）\n84: \"$B\" -b -P pipeline/v5_anim.py -- --test 60,160,350,760,1120,1640,1730\n85: ```\n86: \n87: ## 视口流畅度加速\n88: \n89: 场景共 668 个对象（608 个网格）。通过 `v5_viewport_fast.py` 一键切换视口轻量化模式（仅改 `hide_viewport` 与网格 `display_type`，渲染不受任何影响）：\n90: \n91: ```bash\n92: B=\"/d/APPs/steam/steamapps/common/Blender/blender.exe\"\n93: \n94: # 快速模式：看台/道具/地形集合视口隐藏，重网格切换为 BOUNDS 包围盒并自动保存\n95: \"$B\" -b LATEST/v5_stage_anim.blend -P pipeline/v5_viewport_fast.py -- fast\n96: \n97: # 恢复默认实体贴图显示并保存\n98: \"$B\" -b LATEST/v5_stage_anim.blend -P pipeline/v5_viewport_fast.py -- normal\n99: ```\n100: \n101: UI 常用快捷键：`Z` → Solid、`Numpad /` 局部独显选中、`Numpad .` 聚焦选中、Outliner 点击集合眼睛开关。\n102: \n103: ## 复现环境\n104: \n105: Blender 5.3.0，无独立 GPU（Cycles compute device = NONE），EEVEE 纯 CPU 光线追踪，1080p 32 samples 单帧约 2.0–2.8 s。","truncated_fields":["content"]}
{"step_index":78,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-18T06:21:03Z","content":"Created At: 2026-11-18T14:21:03+08:00\nCompleted At: 2026-11-18T14:21:15+08:00\nShowing lines 1-31 of 31\n1: LATEST — 最新工程\n2: =================\n3: \n4: v5_stage_anim.blend       完整交付工程：赛车模型 + 骨架 + 银石增强环境 + 2161 帧遥测动画 + 26 机位（含广播级 DOF）+ 渲染设置\n5: v5_stage_env.blend        纯环境与材质基线（无动画）：改赛道建筑/贴图/光照时改 pipeline/v5_env.py 重跑生成\n6: v5_stage_anim_clay.blend  白模工程：同一套动画、26 机位、DOF 与运动模糊，替换为中性雕塑灰模（Standard 视图防过曝曲线）\n7: \n8: 打开 v5_stage_anim.blend 后：\n9: \n10:   1. Outliner 里按集合找东西（根 Scene Collection 保持 0 散落对象）：\n11:        SCIFI_F1_2035   F1 赛车骨架 RIG_F1_Race 与全部 244 个车身/底盘/方向盘/轮组/贴花部件\n12:        V5_01_Road      路面（含离线橡胶碎屑色差）/ 赛车线 / 重刹胎痕带 / 边线 / 红白路肩 / 香肠路肩 / pit lane\n13:        V5_02_Terrain   地面 / 割草条纹草地 / 砾石坑 / 外围灌篱环 / 平滑大气渐变黄昏穹顶 V5_SkyDome\n14:        V5_03_Barriers  护栏基座 / 金属护栏 / 顶沿灯带 / 防护网立柱\n15:        V5_04_Stands    6 座看台（Empty 组件父级 + 分块观众席/顶棚/钢桁架/旗帜）\n16:        V5_05_Pit       维修墙 / 指挥台大屏 / 维修区出口绿灯信号柱 / 6 车位循环车库楼 / 楼顶看台\n17:        V5_06_Props     广告板 / 刹车距离牌 / DRS 提示牌 / 弯心防撞柱 / 大屏 / 人行天桥 / 裁判点 / 机库 / 起跑龙门架\n18:        V5_07_Lighting  太阳主光 + 天空冷补光 + 3 盏随车柔光（Light Linking 绑定 V5_CarLightReceivers 全部赛车网格）\n19:        V5_08_Cameras   26 台分镜摄影机（Cam_S01..Cam_S25）+ 全程锁定赛车的景深焦点 V5_CamFocus\n20: \n21:   2. 每个看台/天桥/大屏/刹车牌组/裁判点/龙门架都有组件 Empty 父物体，选中 Empty 按 G / R 即可整体移动旋转；\n22:      独立环境网格原点均位于自身几何中心。只有\"路面本身\"按中心线整体生成，改赛道几何请改 track_data 的 json 重跑。\n23: \n24:   3. 时间轴 1–2161 帧（24 fps / 90.04 s / 162 拍 @ 108 BPM），机位切换由 timeline markers 自动驱动。\n25: \n26:   4. 视口流畅度切换（仅改 hide_viewport / MESH display_type，不影响 F12 或命令行渲染）：\n27:        blender -b LATEST/v5_stage_anim.blend -P pipeline/v5_viewport_fast.py -- fast\n28:        blender -b LATEST/v5_stage_anim.blend -P pipeline/v5_viewport_fast.py -- normal\n29:      或在 UI 里按 Z -> Solid、关掉 V5_04_Stands / V5_06_Props 眼睛、选中对象按 Numpad / 进局部视图。\n30: \n31: .blend1 是 Blender 自动备份，可安全删除。"}
{"step_index":79,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-18T06:21:15Z","input_tokens":6883,"cache_read_tokens":180808,"output_tokens":272,"thinking":"I'm thinking through how to approach this.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"read_file","args":{"EndLine":"400","Path":"\"D:\\\\项目session\\\\blender-supercar\\\\docs\\\\README_V5.md\"","StartLine":"1"}},{"name":"read_file","args":{"Path":"\"D:\\\\项目session\\\\blender-supercar\\\\pipeline\\\\mux_v5.sh\""}},{"name":"read_file","args":{"Path":"\"D:\\\\项目session\\\\blender-supercar\\\\pipeline\\\\mux_clay.sh\""}}]}
{"step_index":80,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-18T06:21:39Z","content":"Created At: 2026-11-18T14:21:39+08:00\nCompleted At: 2026-11-18T14:21:39+08:00\nShowing lines 1-183 of 183\n1: # V5 — 真实银石赛道整圈（90 s / 26 机位 / 广播级景深 / 遥测驱动视听全链路）\n2: \n3: V4 的问题不是材质也不是运镜，是**赛道是手搓的**：1.8 km 两个弯，车速和曲率各写各的关键帧，弯心速度不受抓地力约束，观众说不出哪里假，但看着就是假。\n4: \n5: V5 把这一步彻底换掉了：赛道几何、赛车线、每一帧的车速和曲率全部来自真实银石（OpenStreetMap `type=circuit` relation 51160，闭环 2 m 重采样）。车不是\"按节奏摆出来的\"，而是**被弯道半径和抓地力上限顶出来的**；同时全片 26 机位画面与 1.6L V6 涡轮混动引擎声浪均由同一份逐帧物理遥测同步驱动。\n6: \n7: ---\n8: \n9: ## 1. V4 → V5 核心升级\n10: \n11: | 项目 | V4 | V5（最新增强版） |\n12: |---|---|---|\n13: | 赛道几何 | 手写曲率关键帧积分，1 779 m，2 个 90° 弯 | 真实银石，5 834 m，**18 个弯**，2 m 闭环采样 |\n14: | 驱动变量 | 帧号均分 | **`t`（物理经过时刻插值）** |\n15: | 朝向与轨迹 | 位移差反推 + 自积分轨迹 | 直接取 `heading_deg` + **`racing_xy` 赛车线** |\n16: | 关键帧插值 | LINEAR | 全场景 Action（120 527+ 关键帧）显式强制 `LINEAR` |\n17: | 片长与机位 | 30 s / 720 帧 / 10 机位 | **90.04 s / 2 161 帧 / 26 机位**（108 BPM 拍点切镜） |\n18: | 广播级景深 | 估算距离对焦（追随镜头焦点偏前 3–4.6 m） | 独立焦点追踪器 **`V5_CamFocus`**（锁定 `Bone_Root + 0.45m Z`），长焦/近景 `f/2.8–f/4.0` 奶油虚化 |\n19: | 车载机位 | 鼻锥最前端盲拍（看不到座舱与方向盘） | **F1 座舱 Halo / 防滚架机位**（`S02`/`S19`），实时展示方向盘转动（`9.5:1`）、15 颗三色换挡灯与前轮转向 |\n20: | 遥测灯光与热辉光 | 瞬时刹车值无退火、雨灯与排气管材质混用 | 对流冷却热惯性碳陶刹车盘+卡钳\n<truncated 12417 bytes>\n`.blend` 渲染全部 26 张 1080p 剧照并拼装高清标注版 `renders_v5/stills/contact_sheet.jpg` |\n150: | `pipeline/v5_viewport_fast.py` | 视口轻量化开关（`-- fast` / `-- normal`，仅对 `MESH` 切换 `BOUNDS` 并写回保存） |\n151: | `pipeline/synth_sfx.py` | 遥测同步 F1 V6 涡轮混动引擎声合成 → `renders_v5/sfx_engine_90s.wav` |\n152: | `pipeline/render_v5.py` / `render_clay.py` | 彩色 / 白模 2 161 帧全片序列渲染 |\n153: | `pipeline/mux_v5.sh` / `mux_clay.sh` | 封装无声版、纯配乐版与 `*_sfx_1080p.mp4` 引擎混音成片（支持 `--sfx-only` 快速重混） |\n154: \n155: ### 复现命令\n156: \n157: ```bash\n158: B=\"/d/APPs/steam/steamapps/common/Blender/blender.exe\"\n159: \n160: # 1. 贴图 + 环境 + 动画 + 白模工程\n161: python pipeline/gen_textures.py\n162: \"$B\" -b -P pipeline/v5_env.py\n163: \"$B\" -b -P pipeline/v5_anim.py\n164: \"$B\" -b -P pipeline/v5_clay.py\n165: \n166: # 2. 快速渲染全部 26 镜头 1080p 剧照与拼图（约 1 min，无需重渲 2161 帧）\n167: \"$B\" -b LATEST/v5_stage_anim.blend -P pipeline/v5_stills.py -- --render\n168: \"$B\" -b -P pipeline/v5_clay.py -- --render-stills\n169: \n170: # 3. 合成遥测引擎声浪并封装成片\n171: python pipeline/synth_sfx.py\n172: bash pipeline/mux_v5.sh --sfx-only\n173: bash pipeline/mux_clay.sh --sfx-only\n174: ```\n175: \n176: ---\n177: \n178: ## 8. 边界说明\n179: \n180: - **平面高程**：OSM 赛道中心线 `z=0`；银石本身为二战机场改建赛道、地势平坦，如需厘米级起伏需额外叠加 LiDAR DEM 数据。\n181: - **单车计时圈**：当前为单台 F1 飞驰排位圈（Qualifying Hotlap），不含多车缠斗与进站换胎动画。\n182: - **遥测拟合精度**：速度剖面与 8 档引擎转速由真实弯道曲率与下压力抓地力包线推演，视听节奏与真实银石杆位车载高度吻合，但并非某一场官方 ECU 原始采样。\n183: - **数据许可**：赛道中心线源自 OpenStreetMap（ODbL），公开发布请署名 `© OpenStreetMap contributors`。","truncated_fields":["content"]}
{"step_index":81,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-18T06:21:39Z","content":"Created At: 2026-11-18T14:21:39+08:00\nCompleted At: 2026-11-18T14:21:39+08:00\nShowing lines 1-46 of 46\n1: #!/bin/bash\n2: # V5 合成：2161 帧 -> 1080p H.264（无声版 / 纯配乐版 / F1 V6 遥测引擎混音版）\n3: # 用法:\n4: #   bash pipeline/mux_v5.sh              # 完整生成无声版 + 纯配乐版 + 引擎混音版\n5: #   bash pipeline/mux_v5.sh --sfx-only   # 复用已有无声版，仅重制引擎音轨混音与 *_sfx_1080p.mp4\n6: set -e\n7: \n8: FF=/c/Users/86052/scoop/shims/ffmpeg.exe\n9: PY=$(command -v python || command -v python3)\n10: PROJ=\"D:/项目session/blender-supercar\"\n11: FR=\"$PROJ/renders_v5/frames\"\n12: AUD=\"$PROJ/renders_v5/audio_v5_90s.m4a\"\n13: SFX_WAV=\"$PROJ/renders_v5/sfx_engine_90s.wav\"\n14: SFX_MIX=\"$PROJ/renders_v5/audio_v5_sfx_mix_90s.m4a\"\n15: SILENT=\"$PROJ/renders_v5/f1_silverstone_lap_silent.mp4\"\n16: OUT=\"$PROJ/renders_v5/f1_silverstone_lap_1080p.mp4\"\n17: OUT_SFX=\"$PROJ/renders_v5/f1_silverstone_lap_sfx_1080p.mp4\"\n18: \n19: if [ \"${1:-}\" != \"--sfx-only\" ]; then\n20:   # 1) 无声版\n21:   \"$FF\" -hide_banner -loglevel warning -stats -y -framerate 24 -i \"$FR/f_%04d.jpg\" \\\n22:     -c:v libx264 -preset slow -crf 17 -pix_fmt yuv420p \\\n23:     -movflags +faststart \"$SILENT\"\n24: \n25:   # 2) 纯配乐版（After Hours / 108 BPM）\n26:   \"$FF\" -hide_banner -loglevel warning -y -i \"$SILENT\" -i \"$AUD\" \\\n27:     -map 0:v -map 1:a -c:v copy -c:a aac -ar 48000 -ac 2 -b:a 192k -shortest \\\n28:     -movflags +faststart \"$OUT\"\n29: fi\n30: \n31: # 3) 遥测驱动 F1 V6 混合动力音效合成 + 配乐混音（AAC 256k, True Peak <= -1.0 dBFS, 末 1.5s 淡出）\n32: if [ ! -f \"$SFX_WAV\" ]; then\n33:   \"$PY\" \"$PROJ/pipeline/synth_sfx.py\"\n34: fi\n35: \n36: \"$FF\" -hide_banner -loglevel warning -y -i \"$AUD\" -i \"$SFX_WAV\" \\\n37:   -filter_complex \"[0:a]aresample=48000,pan=stereo|c0=c0|c1=c0,atrim=0:90.041667,asetpts=PTS-STARTPTS,volume=-3.8dB,equalizer=f=600:t=q:w=1.3:g=-2.2,equalizer=f=2200:t=q:w=1.5:g=-1.6[mus];[1:a]highpass=f=68:poles=2,volume=-3.2dB,asplit=2[sfx_sc][sfx_mix];[mus][sfx_sc]sidechaincompress=threshold=0.14:ratio=2.6:attack=12:release=190:makeup=1[mus_duck];[mus_duck][sfx_mix]amix=inputs=2:normalize=0,afade=t=in:st=0:d=0.08,afade=t=out:st=88.541667:d=1.5:curve=qsin,alimiter=limit=0.81:attack=4:release=45:level=disabled[outa]\" \\\n38:   -map \"[outa]\" -c:a aac -b:a 256k -ar 48000 -ac 2 \\\n39:   -movflags +faststart \"$SFX_MIX\"\n40: \n41: # 4) 正片 + F1 引擎音效混音版\n42: \"$FF\" -hide_banner -loglevel warning -y -i \"$SILENT\" -i \"$SFX_MIX\" \\\n43:   -map 0:v -map 1:a -c:v copy -c:a copy -shortest \\\n44:   -movflags +faststart \"$OUT_SFX\"\n45: \n46: ls -la \"$SILENT\" \"$OUT\" \"$SFX_MIX\" \"$OUT_SFX\""}
{"step_index":82,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-18T06:21:39Z","content":"Created At: 2026-11-18T14:21:39+08:00\nCompleted At: 2026-11-18T14:21:39+08:00\nShowing lines 1-48 of 48\n1: #!/bin/bash\n2: # 白模成片合成：clay_frames -> 1080p H.264（无声版 / 纯配乐版 / F1 V6 遥测引擎混音版）\n3: # 用法:\n4: #   bash pipeline/mux_clay.sh            # 完整生成无声版 + 纯配乐版 + 引擎混音版\n5: #   bash pipeline/mux_clay.sh --sfx-only # 复用已有无声版，仅重制 *_clay_sfx_1080p.mp4\n6: set -e\n7: \n8: FF=/c/Users/86052/scoop/shims/ffmpeg.exe\n9: PY=$(command -v python || command -v python3)\n10: PROJ=\"D:/项目session/blender-supercar\"\n11: FR=\"$PROJ/renders_v5/clay_frames\"\n12: AUD=\"$PROJ/renders_v5/audio_v5_90s.m4a\"\n13: SFX_WAV=\"$PROJ/renders_v5/sfx_engine_90s.wav\"\n14: SFX_MIX=\"$PROJ/renders_v5/audio_v5_sfx_mix_90s.m4a\"\n15: SILENT=\"$PROJ/renders_v5/f1_silverstone_clay_silent.mp4\"\n16: OUT=\"$PROJ/renders_v5/f1_silverstone_clay_1080p.mp4\"\n17: OUT_SFX=\"$PROJ/renders_v5/f1_silverstone_clay_sfx_1080p.mp4\"\n18: \n19: if [ \"${1:-}\" != \"--sfx-only\" ]; then\n20:   # 1) 白模无声版\n21:   \"$FF\" -hide_banner -loglevel warning -stats -y -framerate 24 -i \"$FR/f_%04d.jpg\" \\\n22:     -c:v libx264 -preset slow -crf 18 -pix_fmt yuv420p \\\n23:     -movflags +faststart \"$SILENT\"\n24: \n25:   # 2) 白模纯配乐版（After Hours / 108 BPM）\n26:   \"$FF\" -hide_banner -loglevel warning -y -i \"$SILENT\" -i \"$AUD\" \\\n27:     -map 0:v -map 1:a -c:v copy -c:a aac -ar 48000 -ac 2 -b:a 192k -shortest \\\n28:     -movflags +faststart \"$OUT\"\n29: fi\n30: \n31: # 3) 确保 F1 V6 引擎音轨与混音母带存在\n32: if [ ! -f \"$SFX_WAV\" ]; then\n33:   \"$PY\" \"$PROJ/pipeline/synth_sfx.py\"\n34: fi\n35: \n36: if [ ! -f \"$SFX_MIX\" ] || [ \"$SFX_WAV\" -nt \"$SFX_MIX\" ]; then\n37:   \"$FF\" -hide_banner -loglevel warning -y -i \"$AUD\" -i \"$SFX_WAV\" \\\n38:     -filter_complex \"[0:a]aresample=48000,pan=stereo|c0=c0|c1=c0,atrim=0:90.041667,asetpts=PTS-STARTPTS,volume=-3.8dB,equalizer=f=600:t=q:w=1.3:g=-2.2,equalizer=f=2200:t=q:w=1.5:g=-1.6[mus];[1:a]highpass=f=68:poles=2,volume=-3.2dB,asplit=2[sfx_sc][sfx_mix];[mus][sfx_sc]sidechaincompress=threshold=0.14:ratio=2.6:attack=12:release=190:makeup=1[mus_duck];[mus_duck][sfx_mix]amix=inputs=2:normalize=0,afade=t=in:st=0:d=0.08,afade=t=out:st=88.541667:d=1.5:curve=qsin,alimiter=limit=0.81:attack=4:release=45:level=disabled[outa]\" \\\n39:     -map \"[outa]\" -c:a aac -b:a 256k -ar 48000 -ac 2 \\\n40:     -movflags +faststart \"$SFX_MIX\"\n41: fi\n42: \n43: # 4) 白模 + F1 引擎音效混音版\n44: \"$FF\" -hide_banner -loglevel warning -y -i \"$SILENT\" -i \"$SFX_MIX\" \\\n45:   -map 0:v -map 1:a -c:v copy -c:a copy -shortest \\\n46:   -movflags +faststart \"$OUT_SFX\"\n47: \n48: ls -la \"$SILENT\" \"$OUT\" \"$SFX_MIX\" \"$OUT_SFX\""}
